td></tr><tr><td>Customer</td><td>customer@kittenfactory.test</td><td>Workshop-2026</td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li>A wrong email or password shows one general message, so the page does not reveal which accounts exist.</li><li>After 5 failed attempts the form pauses for 30 seconds.</li><li>The final system will check hashed passwords on the server with PHP sessions.</li></ul></aside></div></main>
